note: HUMANLANG ODYSSEY: SEVEN WORLDS. Made with HumanLang 0.6.2.
note: Your logo reveal plays first (play video), then the title and the Motherboard hub with its seven worlds:
note: 1 Say Hello, 2 Lists and Machines, 3 Word and Number Town, 4 Pixel Gallery, 5 Platform Peaks, 6 The Boss Citadel, 7 Your World. The hero is the HL mascot, drawn at pixel size 1 like every important picture here.
note: Keys: left/right run, space jumps, enter talks, opens doors and confirms. World 4 and 7 explain their keys on the screen.

use math
use text

note: The hero: the HL mascot, from your sprite sheet (11 frames: 1 stand, 2-6 run, 7 jump up, 8 top of the jump, 9 fall, 10 hurt, 11 cheer). Pixel size 1.
make a sprite called hero with pixel size 1 and 11 frames
